00:04:46.881 --> 00:04:48.518
But, what I do think about,

00:04:48.518 --> 00:04:49.958
the one thing that is interesting to me,

00:04:49.958 --> 00:04:52.233
is I do feel that all of us,

00:04:52.233 --> 00:04:54.416
especially the ones that decide
to participate in putting

00:04:54.416 --> 00:04:57.516
out content, which if
you look at the data,

00:04:57.516 --> 00:05:01.579
may not be at full, full scale
in the 70s, 80s, and 90s,

00:05:01.579 --> 00:05:03.278
gets bigger as you go down.

00:05:03.278 --> 00:05:04.830
And as the younger you get,

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.198
the more you're really putting out content

00:05:06.198 --> 00:05:09.914
whether in private form or public form.

00:05:09.914 --> 00:05:12.572
I think the most
interesting thing is that,

00:05:13.462 --> 00:05:15.799
I think we're losing peace of mind.

00:05:15.799 --> 00:05:19.382
And that's different than privacy.

00:05:19.382 --> 00:05:23.030
I think that we all now
know we're living a life

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:24.239
