00:05:53.506 --> 00:05:55.108
I think we're losing the middle.

00:05:55.108 --> 00:05:56.548
Maybe I'll change my answer because

00:05:56.548 --> 00:05:57.546
when I think about what's happening,

00:05:57.546 --> 00:05:59.319
is everybody's like, look at me,

00:05:59.319 --> 00:06:01.875
I'm at a Beyonce concert front row, right?

00:06:01.875 --> 00:06:03.286
By the way,

00:06:03.286 --> 00:06:05.347
massively interesting data
that I'm looking at of why

00:06:05.347 --> 00:06:08.960
people are now going to
public events just to take

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:10.385
the selfie to say they were there,

00:06:10.385 --> 00:06:12.179
which is why concert and sporting events,

00:06:12.179 --> 00:06:14.646
it's amazing how social is
making the real world business

00:06:14.646 --> 00:06:15.551
go up.

00:06:15.551 --> 00:06:16.584
But then, number two,

00:06:16.584 --> 00:06:18.093
I see a lot of people on my Facebook feed

00:06:18.093 --> 00:06:19.011
and my social feeds,

00:06:19.011 --> 00:06:20.306
sharing their tragedies.

00:06:20.758 --> 00:06:23.138
Literally, yesterday's Facebook scroll,

00:06:23.138 --> 00:06:24.299
which I do occasionally,

00:06:24.299 --> 00:06:28.503
was literally people announcing
that they've become sick

00:06:28.503 --> 00:06:31.740
or pictures of their daughter
with open heart surgery.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.574
Just these real extreme emotions,

00:06:33.574 --> 00:06:35.361
and then the other things which is like,

00:06:35.361 --> 00:06:37.277
I'm at Bora Bora and
I'm living the best life

00:06:37.277 --> 00:06:38.660
and I'm pouring champagne down my throat.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:41.560
The middle is getting
kind of squeezed as we are

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:42.935
going to social.

00:06:43.935 --> 00:06:46.037
Ironically, the middle is peaceful, right?

00:06:46.037 --> 00:06:47.993
The middle is less tense.

00:06:47.993 --> 00:06:50.512
The middle is relaxing.

00:06:50.512 --> 00:06:52.311
The little lacks tension.

00:06:52.311 --> 00:06:53.912
So, for me,

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:56.336
I'm good because I need insanity.

00:06:56.336 --> 00:06:57.624
Like right now I'm pissed.

00:06:57.624 --> 00:06:59.331
As you may notice behind me,

00:06:59.331 --> 00:07:01.416
we've opened up a 12th floor.

00:07:01.416 --> 00:07:04.963
(hip hop music)

