an anomaly of somebody who

00:07:24.731 --> 00:07:28.333
needs to blast Weezy songs, at full blast,

00:07:28.333 --> 00:07:31.383
for a six-hour flight to San
Francisco yesterday to get off

00:07:31.383 --> 00:07:33.553
and be able to do my thing.

00:07:33.553 --> 00:07:35.469
I worry about the people
that are more centered

00:07:35.469 --> 00:07:39.287
or introverted in this
environment where we're getting

00:07:39.287 --> 00:07:42.468
suffocated by storytelling
and our public personas,

00:07:42.468 --> 00:07:45.487
whether we intend to do it or
we become a byproduct of it.

00:07:45.487 --> 00:07:49.992
So, I think separating our public life

00:07:49.992 --> 00:07:51.617
to our private life is going to become

00:07:51.617 --> 00:07:53.873
