and we're losing that.

00:07:53.873 --> 00:07:56.171
It was just a hell of a
lot easier back in the day.

00:07:56.171 --> 00:07:57.966
Ironically, keep it rolling,

00:07:57.966 --> 00:08:00.543
ironically, I think that's
where Snapchat's winning.

00:08:00.543 --> 00:08:03.387
I think Snapchat is content of the middle.

00:08:03.387 --> 00:08:05.856
